### User Profile API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..hAq_zRGzc3gQHiWPJNz4t_G6S3QEIqaYAsMMz7IIqQw

### 1. Get Profile - Valid Authentication Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2. Get Profile - Valid Authentication Token (Alternative)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer valid-jwt-token-here

### 3. Get Profile - Valid Authentication Token (Long Format)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer abc123def456ghi789jkl012mno345pqr678stu901vwx234yz567890abcdef

### 4. Verify Token - Valid Authentication Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-token
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 5. Verify Token - Valid Authentication Token (Alternative)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-token
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer valid-jwt-token-here

### 6. Verify Token - Valid Authentication Token (UUID Format)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-token
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..hAq_zRGzc3gQHiWPJNz4t_G6S3QEIqaYAsMMz7IIqQw

### 7. Verify Token - Valid Authentication Token (Alphanumeric)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-token
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer AUTH2024ABC123DEF456GHI789